        "desc": "At an available god's own altar, permanently steal its single offered benefit and accept its wrath. Choose at most three distinct gods. The first theft supplies forty Defiance once; later thefts never refill it. Duplicate and ecumenical altars grant nothing. Profanation does not consume the altar or prevent an ally from worshipping there.\n\nDefiance 0/100; Elder Rites 0/3.\nRange: N/A\n\nThis ability costs: nothing.",
