        "name": "Invoke Elder Rites",
        "desc": "At XL9, XL15 and XL21, complete one short two-wave encounter to strengthen all your stolen benefits. Begin on safe open ground. The second wave arrives after four standard turns without waiting for the first wave to die. Trial actors grant no rewards. Killing or permanently banishing every trial actor wins; pacification, conversion and dismissal do not. Leaving the floor abandons the attempt, preserving completed rites. Only one party rite can be active on a floor.\n\nDefiance 0/100; Elder Rites 0/3.\nRange: N/A\n\nThis ability costs: nothing.",
